{"id":"d6866169a02ae8da","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-polymodal-formula.md","title":"Finitary Polymodal Formula Language","display":"df-polymodal-formula — Finitary Polymodal Formula Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-polymodal-formula","aliases":["89-df-polymodal-formula"],"display":"df-polymodal-formula — Finitary Polymodal Formula Language","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-polymodal-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-polymodal-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polymodal-formula — Finitary Polymodal Formula Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> 为已有可数命题字母集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>）为相互不同的一元标记构造子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polymodal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nP_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nP_{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq P_k\\cup\\{\\neg A,[n]A\\mid A\\in P_k,n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in P_k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}P_k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Idx}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathrm{Idx}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Idx}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Idx}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Idx}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Idx}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Idx}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Idx}([n]A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Idx}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polymodal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nP_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nP_{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq P_k\\cup\\{\\neg A,[n]A\\mid A\\in P_k,n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in P_k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}P_k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Idx}(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathrm{Idx}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Idx}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Idx}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Idx}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Idx}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Idx}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Idx}([n]A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Idx}(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章 p.207，GLP。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>每个阶段是集合，每个公式仍是有限语法树。允许可数种盒，不能把它改为含无限合取或无限盒链的语言。双模态语法通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_i\\mapsto[i]\">\\(\\Box_i\\mapsto[i]\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=0,1\">\\(i=0,1\\)</span>）嵌入。</p>\n<p>本条显式补出原书 p.207 所用的多模态语言和索引接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polymodal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nP_0&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nP_{k+1}&\\coloneqq P_k\\cup\\{\\neg A,[n]A\\mid A\\in P_k,n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in P_k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_P&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}P_k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Idx}(p)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathrm{Idx}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Idx}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Idx}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Idx}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Idx}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Idx}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Idx}([n]A)&\\coloneqq\\{n\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Idx}(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box_i\\mapsto[i]","display":false},{"tex":"i=0,1","display":false}],"bytes":1493,"backlinks":[{"id":"5518caddec83ace1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-polymodal-formula]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"GLP（p.207）：[[89-df-polymodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glp-logic]] → [[89-df-glsp-logic]] → [[89-lem-glp-finite-support]]；与 GLB 的连接见 [[89-prop-glb-glp-embedding]]。"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}